# Re-include the Gradle wrapper jar/properties, which *.jar / gradle.properties
# above would otherwise exclude. Must stay at the end of the file: git applies
# .gitignore patterns in order, so a later broad rule can silently re-exclude
# an earlier negation (this is what caused gradle-wrapper.jar to never be
# committed in the first place).
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties
